  "definition": "Lake Winnipesaukee",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-01-13",
  "historyNote": "#8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.75); amd by #8614, eff 4-25-06; amd by #9731, eff 6-24-10; ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.88) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100); amd by #12171, EXEMPT, eff 5-4-17; ss by #13326, eff 1-13-22",
